{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_title", "source_sha256": "f08b87204eecd56591cf2345f007472275e691527a786e4aeec8da6a6be913db", "ja": "君だからできること", "zh": "只有你才办得到的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cd5062afc51c8b2db4b7fe2782f6fcfad18f40d151b100e0afef05a6a41906fc", "ja": "レッスンがうまくいかず落ち込むひなたの\n元に、亜美に盆栽を枯らされたと怒る真美が\nやってくる。田舎のじいちゃんの知恵で\n盆栽を蘇らせたひなたは自信を取り戻し、\nセンター公演をも成功に導くのだった。", "zh": "日向练习得不顺利而陷入低潮，这时候\n真美跑了过来，她正因盆栽被亚美弄枯\n而怒气冲冲。日向运用乡下爷爷的智慧\n救起盆栽后找回自信，也连带为\nCenter公演带来成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6e15be827c210f79c7a30eb036913e2c2e88a20867a61eb833836b9abb9d2e69", "ja": "（ひなたのセンター公演の、レッスンが始まった。\n初日から、みんな頑張ってるな）", "zh": "（日向的Center公演练习开始了。\n大家第一天就这么努力呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "b3cc10eaeda93713d25f06c3ba55f635c20f84e54cb08bc518214ededf1ad804", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nお、お疲れさんでした……。", "zh": "呼、呼……\n辛、辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "506fbc10736347b7314ca40864aa4ef216e25de2accabbd90af3d5deeddbbcc2", "ja": "うぅ……あたし、ちっともうまくできなくて……。\nどうしたらいいんだろか。", "zh": "呜……我根本完全做不好……\n该怎么办才好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c36f27dc14808338ee80487d7ba9799a20633c5bdc761a86959c00a35581e20f", "ja": "そんなに思いつめなくて大丈夫だよ、ひなた。\nレッスンは、まだ始まったばかりなんだから。", "zh": "你不需要给自己这么大的压力，日向。\n练习也才刚开始啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "edca82d1ccbd8b2cc2c29d462824c81f2be6986db3bc186bf75afd30e9d2f3ce", "ja": "そうですよ、ひなたちゃん。\n今日は、初日ですからね～。", "zh": "就是说啊，小日。\n今天才第一天而已～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "69e44f18e5b317ee988716c4b57de037affa7011a539bf2c0eb9d2c4c6028a2f", "ja": "焦る必要はないのです。\nここからしっかり固めていけばいいのです。", "zh": "你不用着急喔。\n只要现在开始好好站稳脚步就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "896978672603752489f4c89afa33a7e0256d17951564b8d184ea3522c81f583a", "ja": "けどあたし、せっかくセンターに選んでもらったのに。\nセンターらしいこと、なんもできてないべさ……。", "zh": "可是，我难得被选为Center，\n却完全做不到Center应该有的样子哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ffbd2835719bb7f0427b459e95e82612321b38bf7c21b0de013f09aa32adde72", "ja": "（まだ自信が持てないせいか、ひなたは不安そうだ。\nこんな時は……）", "zh": "（日向大概是还没有建立起自信，看起来很不安。\n这种时候……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "98456be02a2707d69752415c7069e48a99637c7786e1c8799b4381d2324b7c85", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、「はいほー！」って言ってみるのです。\nさあ、さあ。", "zh": "小日向，你说说看「Hi Ho！」吧。\n快点、快点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "81cddb08002217a40e9e13b4ee1a297ca8ab586484154e27804d9442a66f5a12", "ja": "えっ？\n……は、はいほぉ～……？", "zh": "咦？\n……Hi、Hi Ho～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c1105529966e928557cb8bce81893181270f5b871000a51217e7ec7a8ed5ef6", "ja": "ふむふむ、なかなかいい感じなのです。\nその調子でもう1回、今度は大きな声で……せーの！", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉很不错喔。\n就照这样再讲一次，这次声音大一点……预备──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "cb3d0001930a9d2e27c0674b1e426bcf71a5dfcea9cd914b972406ebbb7bad2d", "ja": "は、はいほーっ！！　……あ、あれ？", "zh": "Hi、Hi Ho──！！\n……奇、奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e60d6821090a53fab851f1d4d1400d642653b328a7f1c95c74add7c9d8d8b228", "ja": "おお！\nひなた、今すごく声が出てたぞ。", "zh": "哦哦！\n日向，这次的声音很宏亮喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "f7b871a722182e7354499e2e301ac2c936947fa5cf3d15c8777f69b58f0f2039", "ja": "うん……！　不思議だねぇ。\nなんだか、元気が出てきたべさ。", "zh": "嗯……！真是不可思议呢～\n总觉得打起精神了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "6c2b701e5668af8da35aa988f045c3010f8acb43f58ffcad1e5be5e36681f787", "ja": "うふふ、すごいですね～？　まつりさんの\n「はいほー」には、不思議な力があるようです～。", "zh": "呵呵，真的很厉害呢～\n茉莉的「Hi Ho」似乎拥有不可思议的力量～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "e7ad247e5743cd8195214eb4511ee616b135d64f0817ea4d52c4e72b031e93a1", "ja": "魔法の呪文みたいだべさ。\nまつり姫さんは、やっぱしすごいねぇ。", "zh": "就像是魔法咒语一样哪。\n茉莉公主果然很厉害呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8cd582f83a59a51e39bc949a77e54e5b37114c50f2375ac1f7b2982f8376ade", "ja": "あたしにも、まつり姫さんみたいに\nおまじないがあればいいのかなぁ……？", "zh": "我是不是也该像茉莉公主一样\n有个自己的咒语呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1017_p", "source_sha256": "57a0f067438d4c030abcc610a7919c64dcf80a9fa6ad72dc01199dc2b89e2d0d", "ja": "ひなたも、考えてみたらどうだ？\n元気を出すおまじない。", "zh": "日向要不要也来想看看？\n能够让自己打起精神的咒语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "d5720b9eb4c00ef17a1687d220f845e151c9f6f03e63dfea76dde771d332d856", "ja": "あたしがかい？\nえっと、そうだねぇ……。", "zh": "我自己想吗？\n嗯，我想想看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "45e3f73d6a8845bf0bb9946bdbd0c5f5b8689cde665eedc8da60355186bb2bce", "ja": "でっかいどう～！\nど、どうだろか、これ。", "zh": "北海大大道～！\n这、这句怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "da7420f5d3a76e3f718f83b2178d5e55a4c35e59c9837f4f64e0876938095633", "ja": "ふふっ、ひなたちゃんらしくてかわいいのです。\nね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "呵呵，充满小日向的风格，很可爱喔。\n呐？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2c703ab5700ce1611a1ddca262f8b6d901bf37d94e5a105edafe1d1a937e4472", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！\n……ん？　何か、声が……。", "zh": "嗯，就是说啊！\n……嗯？好像有什么声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "5dda3ad0d0425bdfd702267c0f0c9c928ea30530ffea394df4f1baddeb36971f", "ja": "うわーん！　亜美のバカー！！", "zh": "呜哇──！亚美这个笨蛋──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6df12a25d376268fd213a20c8bb87a8d6cadff9025f3dc7079067741bc0385bf", "ja": "うわっ……真美？\nどうしたんだ、そんなに血相を変えて……。", "zh": "唔哇……真美？\n你怎么了，这么生气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "dbd0d342936996530b92a37db91c98ab32bfaee0e3a3d5432cb57aaa8687fdff", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃん！　これ見てよ！　真美のぼんさいの\nボンノスケ、亜美がシオシオにしちゃったんだよー！", "zh": "啊，大哥哥！你看这个啦！真美的盆栽\n盆之助，被亚美弄得奄奄一息的啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f043c2c57006c7f85b3a2621eb34aac17ca951697357cfa589e8696f1680f20a", "ja": "なんだって！？\n（真美、本当にぼんさいを育てて……！）", "zh": "你说什么！？\n（真美真的有在种盆栽……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "19c8d11469e3d43ee87fd4a7c3628e056684f9255ff64c800b535d03ccc4965e", "ja": "亜美、悪気はなかったんだよー！　ただ、ぼんさいに\nジュースかけたら、でっかくなるかなーって……。", "zh": "亚美又不是故意的啊──！\n只是想说，不知道帮盆栽浇果汁会不会长大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "da3fcaf1435e50016bea7261ca20fc6f96617d237954633b4da14c0512d22eea", "ja": "あら……ボンノスケ、しょんぼりしていますね～。\n幹も葉っぱも、カサカサになってしまって……。", "zh": "哎呀……盆之助好没精神呢～\n茎跟叶子都变得干巴巴的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "38ad48b349ed33b20a632deb0ef561c55cfe9d2bfef01302bb28a903ec5a1a4e", "ja": "亜美のせいだー！　亜美のバカ！\nお前の母ちゃんデビルヤキニクマン！", "zh": "都是亚美的错！亚美这个笨蛋！\n你妈是恶魔烧肉人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1029_p", "source_sha256": "15b40aa8e7d84ccedb47bf6ebc366501eeedc0ccc47916270cf9e37843d942b2", "ja": "……それは悪口になってるのか？", "zh": "……这算是坏话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "e3a17126edb0222de01e842746d2fd5c9aded1955f2c22636182fe41f8284702", "ja": "ま、真美だって、この前、亜美のおやつ食べたじゃん！\nおあいこだよーっ！！", "zh": "真、真美之前不是也吃了亚美的点心吗！\n这样就扯平了──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5a4f6adb272879079771f6ad21b990ca2c2662c80a61339729fe8df33a84c0e0", "ja": "ああほら、ふたりともケンカしない。\nしかし、このぼんさいはもうダメかもな……。", "zh": "唉好了，你们别吵了。\n不过，这个盆栽可能已经不行了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "ff5d7269439e4775a20c00f1c5720d40ddada6aef407c2682a3ea7423f6fd352", "ja": "ええ～っ！？\n兄ちゃん、なんで！　ボンノスケ、助からないの！？", "zh": "咦咦～？大哥哥，为什么！\n盆之助已经没有救了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "430f000362fa2853079bed2944202a307e44fc4b5ef65a9e63334335eb663126", "ja": "{$P$}、真美センセー。その\nぼんさい、ちょっこしあたしに見せてくれんかなぁ？", "zh": "{$P$}、真美老师。\n可以让我看一下那个盆栽吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "6240de846c9d7f971aa37263c45858a8db7d2447f7826a362a9029d144515b17", "ja": "ひなぴー？", "zh": "小日日？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "2e3677c14c9ef0b1ea7bdee5a5aafdb145945b45c16b75eca65ab87409eda6e2", "ja": "よしよし、いい子だねぇボンノスケ。\n……ああ、これは土がわやになってるねえ。", "zh": "好乖好乖，盆之助是个好孩子呢～\n……嗯，这个盆栽里的土已经不能用了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1036_035hin", "source_sha256": "7bcf6734ffbad97bf6291557089cbb097d154198005fcc547b74d5a56ce04a03", "ja": "でも根のしっかりした、いいぼんさいだべさ。\nうん……。", "zh": "不过它的根还很健康，是个好盆栽哪。\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "590e273b7cf1e30a2caa77fbe90cb1c257d996d8a7fa2ab50d64d759fbba1fcb", "ja": "真美センセー、亜美シショー。\nあきらめるのは、まだ早いべさ。", "zh": "真美老师、亚美师傅。\n现在放弃还太早了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "a770eccda31c78e56b229124c8c2239859b8133aa0cc610e7eb3eebb4a8ac089", "ja": "えっ。\nひなぴー、どうすんの？", "zh": "咦！\n小日日，那要怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1039_035hin", "source_sha256": "561812339785924af62f3921cdded09d4f876038101bff12c869424293fb6ab0", "ja": "あのね、植物って、枯れてるように見えても\n辛抱強く世話をすると、花を咲かせたりするもんでね。", "zh": "我跟你们说，植物就算看起来枯萎了，\n只要拿出耐心照料，它们还是会开花的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1040_035hin", "source_sha256": "b965fa0ea86be32befc07a5cbbe3945c15e74cf641c2f99cad44b9452cc7401d", "ja": "ボンノスケの根っこは、まだ元気だべさ。\nだから土を変えたら、元気になるかもしれないよぉ。", "zh": "盆之助的根部还很健康哪。\n所以如果换了土，说不定可以让它恢复活力喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1041_012mam", "source_sha256": "7d987737e9e8f6d6e7db7b4261c70e0d5ce1eeb78108d0fab594838bf0554328", "ja": "えっ、それホント！？\nひなぴー、ボンノスケ治せるの？", "zh": "咦，这是真的吗！？\n小日日，盆之助会好起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1042_035hin", "source_sha256": "4e71e1ba681a232faa1fb2726bb89023bee8f770b98d0d5442c96b9ac2449cb4", "ja": "わからんけども、やれるだけやってみるよぉ。\nボンノスケも、がんばってくれっかい？", "zh": "我没有办法保证，但会尽力试试看喔～\n盆之助也愿意一起加油吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1043_035hin", "source_sha256": "16dc152cb65179b33e25418b364f423e4451e23d9f7479285b3fce4c2d54dfbf", "ja": "{$P$}。劇場の植え込みに使う\n土と肥料、ちょっこしもらってもいいだろか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n可以把剧场园艺用的土壤跟肥料分一些给我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1044_p", "source_sha256": "c4978e9e2a239d684ec794d6ae46de262859b1a66bb7b91ac4778015ab4c421c", "ja": "ああ、それくらい全然かまわないけど……。", "zh": "嗯，这点小事不成问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1045_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1046_se", "source_sha256": "08553b04178f59bc99796d4216615056135a400605f1aa4983eea4d954a9fae0", "ja": "……モサッ。\nモサモサモサ……。", "zh": "……（茂盛）\n（茂盛茂盛茂盛）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1047_p", "source_sha256": "0f68e8a961c52e706b483845f35f92025bffafb7b4056a5e976a27ec5b511b85", "ja": "お、おおっ！？　これは……\nボンノスケが、みるみる枝葉を広げて……！？", "zh": "哦、哦哦！？这是……\n盆之助的枝叶转眼变得好茂盛……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1048_012mam", "source_sha256": "062979f67d79b2768c9c9104de2d25eed96c6e612954fe83ca80f8d270e80945", "ja": "わあーっ！？　超元気になったー！\nすごいよ、ひなぴー！　元よりでっかいよ、これ！", "zh": "哇啊──！？盆之助变得超有活力的──！\n你超厉害的，小日日！它长得比原本还大了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1049_011ami", "source_sha256": "60e77e7f39b6ba6ccf219d93e254ae46dae1e05daf14e980ee7b32c0ebd701e9", "ja": "あんがと、ひなぴー！\nおかげで、亜美のウタガイが晴れたよ！", "zh": "谢谢，小日日！\n多亏有你，才洗刷掉亚美的嫌疑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1050_p", "source_sha256": "9ceffc48a062c045dfd4db608da9cf9af7dfe7c8d0fcb86a4f3f758a059380b4", "ja": "べつに疑いは晴れてないけどな。\nまあでも、とにかくすごいぞ、ひなた！", "zh": "根本没有洗刷掉好不好。\n不过，日向你真是太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1051_035hin", "source_sha256": "9d4791cadf5a762e5abbf69967d59a5e747a0968e0ad079220acbdf02d99146c", "ja": "う、うん……こんなに元気になるなんて、\nあたしもビックリしたべさ。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……没想到它会变得这么有活力，\n其实我也吓了一跳哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1052_031tom", "source_sha256": "d288e8ef99686799aafd900990371c959db0475cc53d6e7bf0db24a52c796f2a", "ja": "まさに、奇跡と言うほかありませんね～。\nひなたちゃん、お見事です～。", "zh": "这根本只能说是奇迹了呢～\n小日，太了不起了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1053_021mat", "source_sha256": "9fa599f8ff369bb19dec45397c9256e14911a23315eedd72ea4408378c16cbe0", "ja": "まるで、魔法みたいなのです。\nわんだほー！なのです。", "zh": "简直就像魔法一样的喔。\n太美妙了唷──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1054_035hin", "source_sha256": "dff13ec5cd14e632afd68da305bb6c0b7c56585cb2264b5a71d0ce8ac0d59f31", "ja": "えへへ……そんな、たいしたことないべさ。\n真美センセーのボンノスケが、強かったんだよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……我也没有做什么了不起的事哪。\n主要是真美老师的盆之助很坚强喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1055_011ami", "source_sha256": "5eff4a304971fe50f852c30b7e5a83d25353d4fa86a79f32c06e01aa3578dd6b", "ja": "ねえねえ真美、ボンノスケ、火星とかでも生きられる、\nスペースぼんさいになったんじゃないの！？", "zh": "欸欸真美，盆之助会不会已经变成\n连在火星都能生活的太空盆栽了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1056_012mam", "source_sha256": "6a3f0785df4f0830fb1c5e2809f88d8b1316094a49815c1be95eccd20d2524ef", "ja": "そうかも！\n亜美、さっそく火星行ってたしかめようよ！", "zh": "说不定是耶！\n亚美，我们赶快到火星去试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1057_011ami", "source_sha256": "496d14b4e59660ac07acb9b93b8cb042a138c6c49c27060533291f5e21ae988b", "ja": "んじゃ、さっそく社長に相談しよう！\nレッツラゴー！", "zh": "好，那我们马上去找社长商量吧！\nLet's我们Go！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1058_p", "source_sha256": "ca5efc872184b7814c37e8e277c610309fc66561a3f139bf15f450f237666cf7", "ja": "あ、亜美、真美！　いくら社長でも\n火星は無理だと……行っちゃったか。", "zh": "啊，亚美、真美！\n就算是社长也不可能带你们去火星……已经跑掉了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1059_p", "source_sha256": "7c6e18a43bfb777e93cb20175d0a1b4acea8285c93c45955181970f24fd23d2a", "ja": "それにしてもひなた、本当にすごかったな！\n亜美と真美が仲直りできたのも、ひなたのおかげだ。", "zh": "话说回来，日向，你真的很厉害耶！\n亚美跟真美也是多亏了你才和好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1060_035hin", "source_sha256": "1d2a31b8de2e094718ca00f4484511bc281dd657f9e87624f831736ec5e8c5ce", "ja": "えへ、えへへ……もう、そんなに\nほめなくていいべさ。たまたまっしょや。", "zh": "嘿、嘿嘿……真是的，\n也不用一直称赞我哪，只是碰巧而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1061_035hin", "source_sha256": "cc109e71b6cf4c5d42e286c5589649e90257d6df852bfac516f49ff12bfdbe11", "ja": "ぼんさいのことは、じいちゃんに教わっただけだし。\nあたしは、なんもしてないよぉ。", "zh": "我只是从爷爷那里学过怎么照顾盆栽而已。\n这其实也不是我的功劳喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1062_021mat", "source_sha256": "3fa536de0935a5bf3e6d20067fdbac498a13b29ec0f1c492761e2ab4cf2cdfc9", "ja": "そんなことないのですよ、ひなたちゃん。\n誰にでもできることじゃないのです。", "zh": "话不是这么说的唷，小日向。\n不是任何人都有办法照顾盆栽的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1063_035hin", "source_sha256": "e2e0f1d72c7db4e135baadf696e0d10f3f7a03b9f5da23cf8bd552fe50f509a3", "ja": "そ、そうかい……？\nでもあたし、特別なことは、なんにも……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？\n可是，我真的没有做什么很特别的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_1064", "source_sha256": "f42657a7d6a5654c20047a6613e96373de0083e9e3c8678dc1b5e4287cb4ad9c", "ja": "自信を持って！", "zh": "要对自己有信心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a6744abc5d14695469cde7fa389c9b45ba0aa01e0260f55274de95683c11dff0", "ja": "おじいさんに教えてもらったことも、ひなたの\n身についた事のひとつだ。レッスンと同じだよ。", "zh": "从爷爷那里学到的事情，也是你自己的本领。\n跟训练课程是一样的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2001_p", "source_sha256": "bb0baa05cab94e3472d0e5e14b155665a3d7e3250fe227f7a9ca01f46fc1307a", "ja": "教えてもらった事を覚えていて、実践できたんだ。\n自信を持っていいことだぞ！", "zh": "你记住了人家教你的东西，并且学以致用。\n你应该要对自己更有信心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2002_035hin", "source_sha256": "dfe3b7f9c0be1a0beefb498a35d790ce798b40fe00a250cd25dbd5c9c3399f4f", "ja": "自信かぁ……。えへへ。\nあたしにも、できることがあったんだねぇ。", "zh": "自信吗……嘿嘿。\n原来我也有做得到的事情呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2003_035hin", "source_sha256": "c56b8ac2ffc5e8f1f99453c7d3c39cbb13fd8cbab4edc6279f0737d0e441749d", "ja": "朋花さんやまつり姫さんみたいに、すごい人じゃないと\nセンターなんかとても……って思ってたけども。", "zh": "我一直以为……只有像朋花姊或茉莉公主这样厉害的人，\n才有办法担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2004_035hin", "source_sha256": "728ac8da9071e8f99a36701231e16df15af5ab642ab19a88b1a09bd6fcd0ed73", "ja": "ありがとねえ、{$P$}。\nあたし、なんだか、がんばれそうな気がしてきたよぉ。", "zh": "谢谢你哪，{$P$}。\n我觉得自己有继续努力的动力了哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2005_021mat", "source_sha256": "409aacd04d3f51fefbceb4031fa4edbf34e5f7eb914d615e3950f93d0c150781", "ja": "はいほー！　ひなたちゃんが自信を持てて、\n姫たちもとってもハッピーなのです♪", "zh": "Hi Ho！看见小日向获得自信，\n公主我们也非常开心的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2006_031tom", "source_sha256": "8a60482a7da958f76bd8baad0aac5acce71523d518d4497979b67d31c0e6bd75", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね～。まさか、ぼんさいのおかげで\nこうなるとは、私も予想できませんでしたが……。", "zh": "呵呵，就是说呀～不过，我也没想到托盆栽的福，\n可以产生这么大的效果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2007_031tom", "source_sha256": "6c77d012e772bcde8c3b659c8a7f5728096a42211e1039a5d697824ee0f69f87", "ja": "亜美ちゃんと真美ちゃんが乱入してくれて、\n良かったのではないでしょうか～。", "zh": "或许也要感谢小亚美跟小真美\n中途跑来打扰吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_036_2008_p", "source_sha256": "65627f56beff2070c38807466c2ad92052bd8ddbb709836b8496f6f220194601", "ja": "ああ、まったくだな。\nさ、そろそろレッスンを再開しようか！", "zh": "是啊，你说得对。\n好，差不多也该继续练习了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
